<Project>

  <!--
    WJSS Stage 0.3A-1 - central package management (pinned versions).

    Package identity and versions below are PROPOSED from package metadata known to
    the authoring agent. The Arena environment cannot reach any NuGet endpoint, so
    NO RESTORE COMPATIBILITY IS CLAIMED. The Owner-local restore (first lock-file
    generation, then the locked-mode restore flag) must verify these exact
    identities and versions and MAY bump them to the current stable equivalent as
    part of the same checkpoint review; any bump must update this file in a
    review-correction commit.

    Approved minimum set: Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk, xunit, xunit.runner.visualstudio
    (Stage 0.3A Scope Gate, Owner amendment), plus the embedded web-view host
    Microsoft.Web.WebView2 (Stage 0.4C-K1 Owner dependency decision, 2026-10-12:
    real application-owned WinForms shell, Evergreen runtime, minimum required
    change only, no dependency refresh beyond this package).

    Still not added: coverlet, a third-party logging provider, a validation
    library, and any database or physical-transport vendor package (the S3 list
    in tools/boundary-scan is the machine check of this rule). Library Selection Gate — SELECT_FLUENTMODBUS_5_3_2 — MERGE READY (PR #22 OPEN targeting main `dfce519`/`fdc81d8`/`49e4043` on `d1ea0324`, see ADR-0018 and STAGE_LIBRARY_SELECTION_GATE_REPORT): FluentModbus 5.3.2 (MIT, netstandard2.0, compatible with net10.0) is **SELECTED and genuinely locked** (genuine `adapters/tc-acquisition/packages.lock.json` committed at `49e404356edee64bb9dbaccd395d8bcc66435881`, version 2 net10.0, `uAX793...`, CentralTransitive `Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions 8.0.0` + `System.IO.Ports 8.0.0`), **not a candidate**; NModbus 3.0.83 was evaluated and rejected (no per-operation CancellationToken). **Version changes require a separate Owner-approved dependency gate** — do not bump `Version="5.3.2"` in this PR. Physical protocol (`FC03` vs `FC04`), register (`0`, `40 words`), `Unit ID`, byte/word order, scaling, wire-break, timing, concurrency and hardware behavior remain `CANDIDATE_UNVERIFIED`/`NOT VERIFIED` until One-Node Physical TC gate (see TC_EVIDENCE_SOURCE_REGISTER). Transitive closure of FluentModbus 5.3.2 on netstandard2.0 is pinned explicitly because CentralPackage TransitivePinning is enabled.
  -->

  <PropertyGroup>
    <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
    <CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled>true</CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Test stack (xUnit selection: approved Owner pinning decision, Stage 0.3A). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk" Version="17.12.0" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit" Version="2.9.2" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit.runner.visualstudio" Version="2.8.2" />
    <!--
      Kiosk shell WebView host. Owner-approved package and exact pinned version
      (Stage 0.4C-K1 decision). The Kiosk project references it WITHOUT a version
      so this pin stays the single source of the version.
    -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.Web.WebView2" Version="1.0.4258.31" />
    <!-- Physical TC read-only transport — Library Selection Gate SELECT_FLUENTMODBUS_5_3_2 MERGE READY (FluentModbus 5.3.2 SELECTED, genuinely locked 49e4043, see ADR-0018; version changes require separate Owner gate; physical FC/register/hardware NOT VERIFIED). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="FluentModbus" Version="5.3.2" />
    <!-- Transitive closure of FluentModbus 5.3.2 on net10.0: only Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions and System.IO.Ports are required; System.Memory/System.Runtime.CompilerServices.Unsafe are netstandard2.0-only and not present in the genuine net10.0 lock (see ADR-0018). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="8.0.0" />
    <PackageVersion Include="System.IO.Ports" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
